"patches/5b512dce33d186f4fbe7ed3fa7a5dc7e33d73823-1/20260923T151352Z-59d308d2.patch": "3512444761a5a7ff0d1fa5772af431b9ba08e7456e6df515e03951465b15691b"}, "expected_failure": "assertion failed: (0.6 - jaro(\"a jke\", \"jane a k\")).abs() < 0.001", "fixed_commit": "5b512dce33d186f4fbe7ed3fa7a5dc7e33d73823", "fixed_tree": "31f1347a84204a6a1cbf9bde481a7036495dbc30", "fixes": [{"commit": "5b512dce33d186f4fbe7ed3fa7a5dc7e33d73823", "parent": "cd2e7b3bddceb17bcac0fe319f6fd325107be7ce"}], "patch": "patches/5b512dce33d186f4fbe7ed3fa7a5dc7e33d73823-1/20260923T151352Z-59d308d2.patch", "provenance": "verbatim", "runs": {}, "test_sources": [{"commit": "5b512dce33d186f4fbe7ed3fa7a5dc7e33d73823", "paths": ["src/lib.rs"]}], "tests": ["tests::jaro_diff_with_transposition"]}, "shard": "strsim", "status": "blocked", "subject": "Fix transposition counting in Jaro / JaroWinkler (#56)", "summary": "The original Jaro implementation counts decreases in successive matched positions as transpositions, which undercounts reordered matches and can produce asymmetric similarity scores. For \"a jke\" and \"jane a k\", it yields approximately 0.683333 instead of 0.6. The fix records matched positions in both sequences, compares the matched elements in sequence order, and halves the mismatch count. The selected upstream test gains an assertion for this case in the fix. The reversal restores the original matching and transposition calculation while preserving tests and unrelated changes. No builds or tests were run.", "updated_at": "2026-09-23T15:14:07.422314+00:00"}
